{
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": "G02",
      "operator": "TransformerEngine PyTorch CUDA moe_permute（index 路径）",
      "roles": ["rank 内 token–expert 路由槽", "有符号排序键", "num_out_tokens 保留边界", "供 unpermute 使用的 row_id_map"],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "G02-A1",
          "description": "将全部 token–topK 槽的原始索引作为有符号整数键进行第一次排序，再按 num_out_tokens 划分排序结果并构造 row_id_map。",
          "role": "unknown",
          "upstream_id": null,
          "scope": {"source_id": "s2", "claim": "static", "build": null, "call_id": null},
          "facts": [
            {
              "key": "actual_source",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "observation",
              "explanation": "扩展入口直接把 indices 数据指针转为 int*，以 num_tokens * topK 个槽调用键值对排序。包装器将这些键交给 CUB SortPairs。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s2", "start_line": 31, "end_line": 34, "use": "context"},
                {"source_id": "s2", "start_line": 39, "end_line": 42, "use": "context"},
                {"source_id": "s5", "start_line": 2, "end_line": 7, "use": "context"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "applicable_contract",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "observation",
              "explanation": "此处仅观察到旧代码中的排序结果消费规则。目标是本 rank 保留的路由槽集合。入口向 nvte_permute 传递排序后的行 ID 和输出数，row-map 按排序位置保留前缀，并把其余槽映射为 -1。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s2", "start_line": 63, "end_line": 70, "use": "context"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 18, "use": "context"},
                {"source_id": "s3", "start_line": 12, "end_line": 21, "use": "context"}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "readback": "受评源码为 d73bfa14fb26d186ed8e5eeaad8ef5c1d728cc86。Issue 示例有两条本地路由 a→0、b→1，四个非本地槽为 -1，num_out_tokens 为 2。若该旧版接收这些键，按有符号升序，四个 -1 槽排在两条本地路由之前，row-map 保留的两个位置会落在 -1 槽，两条本地路由都会落入丢弃分支。跳过 -1 的输入约定只见于另一个版本标识下的 Issue 预期，仍缺该旧提交对这一哨兵的同版本约定。分发的旧代码到此证明了排序与 row-map 划分，实际输出数据的写入和后续计算贡献也需相应消费者的证据。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "G06",
      "operator": "SGLang DSPARK NPU 非 compact target verify",
      "roles": ["第一条请求的前缀 KV 长度", "本次 verify 草稿区间的长度贡献", "ForwardBatch CPU 长度镜像", "本地图 replay 的 seq_lens 实参"],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "G06-A1",
          "description": "DSPARK 在普通 NPU target-verify replay 中落入仅 DFlash 元数据路径的回退分支，对已计入本次草稿宽度的 CPU 长度镜像再次加上 captured_req_width，再将结果传给 replay_with_input_update。",
          "role": "primary",
          "upstream_id": null,
          "scope": {"source_id": "s4", "claim": "static", "build": null, "call_id": null},
          "facts": [
            {
              "key": "applicable_contract",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "本地 replay 长度实参须表达当前请求的准确 KV 长度。对本次 verify 而言，它包含前缀和当前草稿区间。指定 backend 缺少 raw-verify 方法且有 CPU 镜像时，DSPARK 的准备端已将草稿宽度计入镜像。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 21, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 24, "end_line": 29, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s5", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 7, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 23, "end_line": 30, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 47, "end_line": 51, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "original_contribution_identity",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "同源项是第一条请求在这一次 target verify 中的同一个草稿 KV 区间。准备端用 verify_w 表示该区间并计入镜像。ForwardBatch 持有该镜像，回退式又以捕获请求宽度表示同一 replay 请求的 verify 区间并再次计入。给定的两个宽度分别为 8，身份由同一请求、同一 verify 和同一长度角色确定。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 20, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 14, "end_line": 20, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 24, "end_line": 29, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 29, "end_line": 43, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 4, "end_line": 4, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 36, "end_line": 40, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 26, "end_line": 30, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "expected_multiplicity",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "对第一条请求的 replay 长度，前缀后的本次草稿区间应计入一次。按给定值，目标长度为 1000 + 8 = 1008。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 21, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 24, "end_line": 29, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 26, "end_line": 30, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 47, "end_line": 49, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "excess_multiplicity",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "ForwardBatch 先取得 1008 的镜像，随后恢复 ScheduleBatch 字段只更换原批次的引用。DSPARK 在回退式中从该 1008 再加 8，列表转换和末尾补零保留首项 1016，消费者收到的首项因此包含同一草稿区间两次。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 21, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 24, "end_line": 29, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 4, "end_line": 4, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 39, "end_line": 40, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s2", "start_line": 13, "end_line": 17, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 26, "end_line": 35, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 47, "end_line": 49, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "implementation_action",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "npu_graph_runner.py 这段旧代码仅为 is_dflash() 取 replay 元数据。DSPARK 与 DFlash 是不同枚举值，故 DSPARK 将 _meta_list 设为 None，回退分支直接对已扩展的 CPU 镜像加宽。调用处原样转发这一结果。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 20, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s3", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 16, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 10, "end_line": 16, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 26, "end_line": 30, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 47, "end_line": 49, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "causal_role",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "准备端的第一次加宽已经得到约定长度 1008。replay 回退分支的第二次加宽首次产生 1016，随后的列表构造及实参转发保留首项。若回退在此条件下保留已扩展长度，消费者收到的首项即为 1008。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 21, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 24, "end_line": 29, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 26, "end_line": 35, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 47, "end_line": 49, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "readback": "在固定提交 52604e1d46c1afb209b50f97174b6d0978a580fb 的指定分支，第一条请求的本地 replay 长度实参满足 C3。前缀 1000 与本次草稿宽度 8 在准备端合成 1008，replay 再次计入该区间后传入 1016。判定止于该实参的静态求值。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "G10",
      "operator": "Quadric ONNX Runtime CPU int8 QLinearConvTranspose",
      "roles": ["输出零点 y_zero_point", "输出重量化后的 int8 元素", "固定输入和权重下的零点对照"],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "G10-A1",
          "description": "核对合法的非零输出零点是否作为加数进入固定模型的 CPU 输出重量化路径。",
          "role": "unknown",
          "upstream_id": null,
          "scope": {"source_id": "s2", "claim": "reported", "build": null, "call_id": null},
          "facts": [
            {
              "key": "actual_source",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "observation",
              "explanation": "Issue 的模型构造代码把 int8 的 y_zp 初始化为名为 y_zero_point 的张量，并接到算子的最后一个输入。本观察仅覆盖模型输入连接。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s1", "start_line": 18, "end_line": 25, "use": "context"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "omitted_contribution",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "hypothesis",
              "explanation": "输出零点可能在重量化路径被遗漏。固定输入和权重零点为 0 时，三个输出零点设置的报告输出逐元素一致，但这些结果无法定位旧 CPU 路径使用的参数或证明加数缺失。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s2", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 2, "use": "context"},
                {"source_id": "s2", "start_line": 9, "end_line": 10, "use": "context"}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "readback": "报告环境为 SDK 26.08、ONNX Runtime 1.20.0 和 CPUExecutionProvider，模型为单批单组。对每个目标元素，参考重量化将 y_zero_point 加到舍入后的缩放累加值，再饱和到 int8。所评三组的 ORT 输出哈希相同，逐元素对照均为 0/147 差异。相对参考结果，输出零点为 0、25、-30 时分别有 1、112、115 个元素不同。目录分类仍待核。需要受评版本中从输出零点取值或实参转发到重量化及写回的旧消费链，或原作者对该链的明确确认，以判定非零加数是否确实缺失及是否存在等价补偿。报告也未绑定可供复核的构建和调用标识。"
    }
  ]
}
